{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/b72d7e384de26607bc5c40ac2106b5d9.poster.avif?t=1763621914\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/b72d7e384de26607bc5c40ac2106b5d9.webm?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/b72d7e384de26607bc5c40ac2106b5d9.mp4?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How deep will you go?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLD ABYSS</strong> is a relaxing and atmospheric exploration game set on the bottom of the ocean. Your objective is simple: repair all broken network cables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Director\u2019s Cut version features new levels, an expanded story, and a completely rebuilt movement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s peace you\u2019re looking for, or something else-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dark depths of the ocean are the perfect place to unwind after a long day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/7d184472ad0614e93e755d08662c0d35.poster.avif?t=1763621914\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/7d184472ad0614e93e755d08662c0d35.webm?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/7d184472ad0614e93e755d08662c0d35.mp4?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a dive to the ocean floor, a place where you can truly be alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expanded version of the original <strong>COLD ABYSS</strong>, featuring new levels and story segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved visuals and gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather artifacts that flesh out the game's setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/63819935db58730dd20a70c14e5ec1f3.poster.avif?t=1763621914\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/63819935db58730dd20a70c14e5ec1f3.webm?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/extras/63819935db58730dd20a70c14e5ec1f3.mp4?t=1763621914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3260040?t=1763621914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/1c6527ec6272e46c2d6ebd5a6a78a1266c06a116/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763621914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/d5e4e6b6c6f4d02293f5e9d21191648a02df7dcd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763621914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3260040/d5e4e6b6c6f4d02293f5e9d21191648a02df7dcd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763621914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"co